<title>NEW ZEALAND: Infratil lifts yr profit to NZ$6.3 mln.</title>
<headline>Infratil lifts yr profit to NZ$6.3 mln.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1997-05-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to March 31.</p>
<p>			   (million NZ$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit				  6.32 vs 4.34</p>
<p>    Shr (cents)				  3.8 vs 4.4</p>
<p>    Div (cents)				 2.25 vs 1.66</p>
<p>    Total div for yr (cents)		 3.0 vs 2.66</p>
<p>    Turnover				    9.32 vs 6.33</p>
<p>    Shares outstanding (million)	 199.6 vs 112.5</p>
<p>Note - Infrastructure and Utilities NZ Ltd is an investor in the infrastructure and utilities sector.</p>
<p>--Wellington Newsroom (64 4) 4734746</p>
